# What to EXCLUDE from the packaged .vsix.
#
# NOTE: we deliberately do NOT exclude `node_modules/**`. This is an UNBUNDLED
# extension with runtime dependencies (qrcode-generator, multicast-dns,
# dns-packet). vsce automatically prunes devDependencies and packages only the
# production dependency tree, so the installed VSIX keeps the modules it needs.
# Excluding all of node_modules here would make the installed extension fail
# with "Cannot find module 'multicast-dns'" even though F5 works.
src/**
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
**/tsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
**/*.map
**/*.ts
.gitignore
.git/**
*.vsix

# Keep build output and metadata.
!out/**
